# wowsims Forever master ad6b13af8 (hotfixes of 16 and 17 November), item pool survival set of 18 November (TANK_SET=surv), 3 min, 3,000 iterations. Full threat consumables with Greater Stoneshield Potion (FEEDBACK_CONSUMES=fullsurv). Protection builds only. Enchants of 18 November: the same enchant rules for all specs (no raid source, no Revered or Exalted reputation source, phase 1 only; tank_gear/search_enchants.py, matched_gear/search_enchants_dps.py). The runs without enchants: logs/finals_surv_full_no_enchants.log. 19 November 2026: the Paladin tank sets take Crusader in place of Revelation (no Protection ability procs Revelation in game) and Libram of Invocation in place of Libram of Holy Alacrity (no effect for Protection). The runs before: logs/finals_surv_full_revelation.log. Later on 19 November: the Paladin survival set takes the 5 pieces of Deathbone Guardian (chest, hands, waist, legs, feet; tank_gear/search_sets.py). The runs before: logs/finals_surv_full_no_deathbone.log.
